 Here is what will change                            in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 In D:\ and every folder inside it, Claude Code will use default
 (you@personal.example).
 Everywhere else stays default (you@personal.example).

 Devpit will write:
   ~/AppData/Roaming/devpit/accounts.toml (adds)
     [[rule]]
     folder = 'D:\'
     claude = "default"

╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ This rule covers every folder on D:\. Apply it to the whole drive?           │
│ Every project on the drive uses this account unless a folder has its own     │
│ choice.                                                                      │
│                                                                              │
│ [ No ]   [ Yes ]                                                             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
[keys] y/n yes/no  ·  enter confirm
